  "evidenceNotes": [
    "All four Queen spell preferences default off,explicit native toggles support research/energy preparation and mixed selection. Per-owner preferences only reach the owner renderer. Saved group slots inherit all four settings atomically on Queen enrollment; individual partial changes preserve slot defaults; non-Queen replacement removes Queen defaults.",
    "Idle/hold/arrived Queens scan every5ticks with4actor rotating budget,20tick grace after enable/enrollment or accepted manual commands. Full existing manual cast validators are reused; no free research,energy,cost changes or auto approach. One success per actor,vision cache refreshed after success. Priority Infestation,Ensnare,Broodlings,Parasite.",
    "Ensnare scores fresh armed combat enemies only,requires2and vetoes any affected friendly except caster; temporary Broodlings excluded. Sixteen nearest anchors and nearest-neighbor midpoints bound scoring. Broodlings choose valid armed ground combat targets worth100minerals+gas per unit,highest value first,and reserve150energy against Parasite only with completed research and an in-range valid target. Parasite excludes existing own infection and temporary Broodlings,prioritizes active detectors then armed/nonworker/worker.",
    "Native portrait360and390 tests locally and publicly use actual Worker/Pixi/touch,paid research and natural energy regeneration. They cover explicit defaults/toggles,automatic no-cost same-ID capture,automatic Parasite,manual hold grace,Ensnare on two Zealots,Broodlings energy reservation/kill/two summons,exact active-effect/preferences/energy/cooldown/lifetime reload,mixed selection and native long-touch group enrollment,all-off cleanup and landscape pause. No state/resource/energy injection or clock acceleration.",
    "Twenty-seven untouched prior public saves from formats12..25 restore at exact ticks,including all three6P Infestation captured/pending production/post-blast states,active Broodlings and Parasite,Ensnare,Medic spells,Stim,energy,cargo,cloak,siege,morphs,pending commands,paid jobs,groups,resources and RNG. Original raw backup bytes match;format25 uses stage6p-backup. Old-save new-state/preference forgery is rejected.",
    "Initial unit testing found an existing group-enrollment undefined optional property that broke canonical JSON comparison; both Medic and Queen group handlers now conditionally update it. Initial browser testing exposed weapon-bearing workers counting as combat clusters; selection now requires kind combat,and a multiple-worker regression protects this. Later harness-only checks were corrected to compare exact energy regeneration and paid cost rather than assuming an arbitrary post-research energy ceiling. Initial attempts are retained separately and excluded from final passing counts.",
    "GitHub main,Sites source,clean canonical release build,saved version,deployed public version and every packaged file hash are verified. Existing Paperoid assets and other games are preserved. Lossless split-member compression keeps the full deploy artifact below32MiB. Source and QA ZIPs pass CRC checks and external SHA256 receipts.",
    "The initial standalone urllib verifier received HTTP403/error1010 with its default User-Agent. Repeating standard browser HTTP requests matched all72canonicalJS/CSS file hashes; native Chromium gameplay and public version verification were performed separately without changing audience or using auth bypass.",
    "Chromium SwiftShader/native touch does not certify physical Android/iOS or hardware GPU. This stage does not complete the entire RTS; Defiler spells,strategic AI,original approach/cast animation and final graphics remain subsequent candidates."
  ],
